&lt;h2&gt;Rust Server&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A native Rust serving layer: tokenizer manager, ingress validation and egress, an OpenAI-compatible API server, and PD disaggregation support, shipped as prebuilt release artifacts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;support rust sglang server: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/29799&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/29799/hovercard&quot;&gt;#29799&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;create rust workspace: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32014&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32014/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32014&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;init sglang rust server project: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32256&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32256/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32256&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;add the rust server tokenizer, detokenizer, and egress modules: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32872&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32872/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32872&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
