&lt;li&gt;add the rust server api frame codec and http server entry: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32875&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/32875/hovercard&quot;&gt;#32875&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
