&lt;h1&gt;Highlights&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DeepSeek V4 support&lt;/strong&gt;: Full inference path for DeepSeek-V4 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4339284660&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23882&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23882/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23882&quot;&gt;#23882&lt;/a&gt;), including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day-0 Features: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4339284660&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23882&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23882/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23882&quot;&gt;#23882&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parallelism: Tensor Parallelism/Expert Parallelism/Context Parallelism/Data Parallel Attention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware: Nvidia B300/B200/H200/H100/GB200/GB300, AMD MI35X&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefill-Decode Disaggregation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HiSparse for offloading inactive KV cache to CPU memory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reasoning parser and Tool Call Parser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DeepGemm and FlashMLA kernels for DeepSeek V4, including MegaMoE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Post-Day-0 additions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HiCache for DeepSeek V4 under unified Radix Tree [UnifiedTree]: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4405980985&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/24691&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24691/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24691&quot;&gt;#24691&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;W4A4 MegaMoE kernels — faster speed with negligible accuracy drop: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4426845156&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25052&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25052/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25052&quot;&gt;#25052&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marlin/FlashInfer W4A8 MoE kernels on Hopper: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4412091350&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/24816&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24816/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24816&quot;&gt;#24816&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4421588802&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/24986&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24986/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24986&quot;&gt;#24986&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faster V2 fused compression kernels: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4415748039&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/24890&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24890/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24890&quot;&gt;#24890&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
