&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.lmsys.org/blog/2026-04-25-deepseek-v4/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;LMSYS blog&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.sglang.io/cookbook/autoregressive/DeepSeek/DeepSeek-V4&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;DeepSeek-V4 cookbook&lt;/a&gt; for more details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TokenSpeed MLA attention backend (Blackwell, FP8 KV cache)&lt;/strong&gt;: New MLA prefill/decode kernels integrated as an attention backend on SM100, with FP8 KV cache support for low-latency MLA serving: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4417791592&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/24925&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24925/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24925&quot;&gt;#24925&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DSv3.2 / GLM-5 FP4 low-latency perf&lt;/strong&gt;: PDL enabled across DSv3.2 / GLM-5 kernels, &lt;code&gt;torch.mm&lt;/code&gt; for the DeepSeek V3.2 indexer GEMM, and a reland of the Cute-DSL FP4 dense GEMM — materially trimming low-latency overheads on FP4 paths: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4346259018&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23965&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23965/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23965&quot;&gt;#23965&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4337663441&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23856&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23856/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23856&quot;&gt;#23856&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4319473830&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23590&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23590/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23590&quot;&gt;#23590&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4449446571&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/25311&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25311/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/25311&quot;&gt;#25311&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
