&lt;h1&gt;Highlights&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CUDA 13 + Torch 2.11&lt;/strong&gt;: Default CUDA version moves to 13.0 across SGLang, sgl-kernel, and Docker images, and PyTorch is upgraded from 2.9 to 2.11 — modernizing the build matrix and unlocking newer kernels: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4124792244&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/21247&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/21247/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/21247&quot;&gt;#21247&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4360846421&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/24162&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24162/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24162&quot;&gt;#24162&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4361891127&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/24183&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24183/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/24183&quot;&gt;#24183&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4319647620&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23593&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23593/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23593&quot;&gt;#23593&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/21498&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/issues/21498/hovercard&quot;&gt;tracking issue #21498&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speculative Decoding V2 by default&lt;/strong&gt;: Spec V2 (with overlap scheduling to hide CPU overhead) is now the default, materially reducing per-step CPU cost for EAGLE/MTP/DFLASH paths: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4111007583&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/21062&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/21062/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/21062&quot;&gt;#21062&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decode Radix Cache for PD Disaggregation&lt;/strong&gt;: Decode-side prefix caching now works under prefill/decode disaggregation, recovering radix-cache hit rates and TTFT savings for long shared prefixes in disaggregated deployments: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4014942552&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/19746&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/19746/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/19746&quot;&gt;#19746&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-0 / New Model Support&lt;/strong&gt;: Gemma 4, GLM-5.1, Qwen3.6, MiMo-V2.5 / V2.5-Pro, Ling-2.6-Flash, Mistral Medium 3.5, and Kimi-K2.6 — with cookbook recipes for tuned deployment commands. See &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.sglang.io/cookbook&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;docs.sglang.io/cookbook&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4195220645&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/21952&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/21952/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/21952&quot;&gt;#21952&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4333446942&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23808&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23808/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23808&quot;&gt;#23808&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4333573080&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23811&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23811/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23811&quot;&gt;#23811&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4337126388&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23851&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23851/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23851&quot;&gt;#23851&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4344285100&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23947&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23947/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23947&quot;&gt;#23947&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4310005263&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23486&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23486/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23486&quot;&gt;#23486&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4304739849&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23394&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23394/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23394&quot;&gt;#23394&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DFLASH Speculative Decoding&lt;/strong&gt;: New high-throughput spec-decode kernel from the kernel community, expanded across model backends and AMD ROCm: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4202298455&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/22077&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22077/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22077&quot;&gt;#22077&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4224624852&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/22358&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22358/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22358&quot;&gt;#22358&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4223039763&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/22342&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22342/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22342&quot;&gt;#22342&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4314643026&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/23553&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23553/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/23553&quot;&gt;#23553&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FA3 Kernels from the Kernel Community&lt;/strong&gt;: Drop-in FA3 kernels contributed by the community, integrated alongside FA4 to give users a high-performance option that&#39;s easy to maintain: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4091850480&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/20796&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/20796/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/20796&quot;&gt;#20796&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LoRA support for DeepSeek-V3 and Kimi-K2&lt;/strong&gt;: LoRA now works on the largest MLA-based MoE models, including DeepSeek-V3 MLA LoRA and Kimi K2 — enabling adapter-based fine-tuning of frontier-scale models: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4222219107&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/22323&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22323/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22323&quot;&gt;#22323&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4227267088&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/22381&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22381/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/22381&quot;&gt;#22381&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
